### Security Baseline

1. SQL must be parameterized; string concatenation is forbidden.
2. Hardcoded keys, tokens, and passwords are forbidden.
3. External input must be validated; output escaped per scenario.
4. Encryption uses the standard library; self-developed algorithms are forbidden.

